        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: യാത്രാവിവരണം",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "യാത്രാവിവരണം — yātrāvivaraṇaṁ — \"a travelogue\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "അവൻ തന്റെ യാത്രയെക്കുറിച്ച് ഒരു യാത്രാവിവരണം എഴുതി. avan tanṟe yātrayekkuṟiccŭ oru yātrāvivaraṇaṁ eḻuti. He wrote a travelogue about his journey."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "വിവരണം, an account, is the noun of വിവരിക്കുക, to describe."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "യാത്രാവിവരണം (yātrāvivaraṇaṁ) is a Malayalam compound built from യാത്ര, from Sanskrit yātrā (CDIAL 10456), and വിവരണം, an account, from Sanskrit vivaraṇa, \"laying open\" (Monier-Williams)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for getting around."
            }
          ]
        },
